---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy — JJAY Campus Companion"
  description="What JJAY Campus Companion stores, where it comes from, and how to delete it. No ads, no tracking, no selling data."
>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p class="muted small">Effective August 24, 2026</p>

  <div class="card summary">
    <p>
      <strong>The short version:</strong> you can use the app without an account. If you make one,
      we store your CUNY email, the reviews and tags you post, and your preferences — nothing else.
      No ads, no tracking, no selling data. Delete your account in the app and everything tied to
      it goes with it.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>An account is optional</h2>
  <p>
    You can browse everything in JJAY Campus Companion — classes, events, campus facilities, and
    professor reviews — without signing up. Anonymous browsing sends us nothing that identifies
    you.
  </p>

  <h2>Signing up requires a CUNY email</h2>
  <p>
    Creating an account requires an email address at one of these domains:
    <code>@login.cuny.edu</code>, <code>@jjay.cuny.edu</code>, or
    <code>@stu-mail.jjay.cuny.edu</code>. This keeps accounts limited to the CUNY community.
  </p>

  <h2>What we store</h2>
  <p>If you create an account, we store:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your email address.</li>
    <li>The professor reviews and tags you post.</li>
    <li>Your account preferences.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    That data lives in <a href="https://supabase.com">Supabase</a>, the backend service the app is
    built on.
  </p>

  <h2>Where the app’s data comes from</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Professor statistics come from <a href="https://www.ratemyprofessors.com">RateMyProfessors</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      Events and calendar data are gathered from public pages on
      <a href="https://www.jjay.cuny.edu">jjay.cuny.edu</a>.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we don’t do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>No ads.</li>
    <li>No selling or sharing your data.</li>
    <li>No tracking SDKs, no analytics, no cookies.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Deleting your account</h2>
  <p>
    Use <strong>Delete account</strong> in the app (in the Profile tab). It removes your account
    and everything tied to it — your email, your reviews and tags, and your preferences.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy or your data:
    <a href="mailto:support@jjayapp.com">support@jjayapp.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Not affiliated</h2>
  <p>
    JJAY Campus Companion is an independent student project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed
    by, or sponsored by John Jay College of Criminal Justice or The City University of New York.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    If this policy changes, the new version is posted here with an updated effective date.
  </p>
</Base>

